WEBVTT

00:01:31.810 --> 00:01:35.160
Erin's new life had begun.

00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:45.120
Now living with Jone the honey man, she's come to the town of Salim to buy the goods necessary for mountain life.

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:50.960
Look.

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:52.820
That's the town of Salim.

00:01:57.450 --> 00:02:03.350
Bird of Dawn

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:05.740
Come and see, come and see.

00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:11.130
Wow!  There are so many people!

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:14.090
This is a place where lots of trading goes on.

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:17.530
Everything and everyone from around the country comes through here.

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:20.130
Really?

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:22.680
What are those people doing?

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:24.160
Wanna go check it out?

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:52.450
They're bards, who travel around the world playing music.

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:05.120
Thank you very much, everyone.

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:12.990
We'll be leaving here tomorrow, but if you see us again somewhere else, please stop and listen again.

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:47.690
<i>I love you, Mom!</i>

00:04:14.510 --> 00:04:15.400
<i>Did I wake you up?</i>

00:04:20.510 --> 00:04:21.930
<i>Can I sleep with you?</i>

00:04:23.390 --> 00:04:27.200
<i>Sure.  It'll be warmer if we sleep together.</i>

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:48.520
Um, why did you stop?

00:04:52.070 --> 00:04:56.340
What was that piece called?

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:00.230
"Bird of Dawn."

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:03.340
"Bird of Dawn?"

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:06.910
It's a very gentle, beautiful piece.

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:08.770
Hey, Erin!

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.700
What are you doing?

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:12.830
Oji-san!  This person was...

00:05:16.690 --> 00:05:18.200
What's wrong?

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:20.130
No...

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.330
It's nothing.

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:33.750
Wait, stop!

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:37.950
Damn it, where did he go?

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:45.720
I'm hungry.

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:49.910
If we had actually gotten a hold of a Touda egg, we would have made so much money.

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:51.720
Don't talk about that!

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:57.070
Didn't we swear to live right for the girl who died in the Lagoe Swamp?

00:05:57.070 --> 00:05:58.500
You're right.

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:02.260
I'll set things right and work hard from now on.

00:06:02.610 --> 00:06:04.190
That's the spirit, Mokku!

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:05.660
Wait!

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:08.210
Out of my way!

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:09.280
What was that?

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:10.120
What is it?

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:11.300
Wait!

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:13.020
Damn it, which way did he go?

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:14.810
Crap, they're government officials.

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:17.040
Did they find out that we were stealing eggs?

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:18.340
We'd better run!

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:29.820
The next shop we're going to sells the best persimmons.

00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:32.670
Hello!

00:06:35.420 --> 00:06:36.650
Looks like they're out.

00:06:36.650 --> 00:06:38.150
That's strange.

00:06:38.150 --> 00:06:42.210
Usually, Talga, the son of the owner, is watching the shop.

00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:46.200
Yuan-san's shop is closed.

00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:48.350
Did something happen?

00:06:48.350 --> 00:06:51.590
She suddenly fell ill and has been in bed ever since.

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:54.140
Her son's gone off into military service, too.

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:56.150
Poor woman.

00:06:56.150 --> 00:06:58.040
Is that so?

00:06:58.040 --> 00:06:59.610
There he is!  Over there!

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:02.820
That's...

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:03.970
Talga!

00:07:03.970 --> 00:07:05.280
Mom!

00:07:06.930 --> 00:07:08.330
Hey, look!

00:07:08.330 --> 00:07:09.640
Little girl!

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:10.890
You're alive!

00:07:11.840 --> 00:07:13.270
It's the two men.

00:07:21.280 --> 00:07:22.750
Who's that guy?

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:26.820
Run!

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:32.380
He's...

00:07:35.740 --> 00:07:36.750
Talga.

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:39.470
Mom!

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:42.320
This is tabchim medicine.

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:42.550
Thanks for the workout, kid.

00:07:42.550 --> 00:07:44.680
Let go!  Let go of me!
Thanks for the workout, kid.

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:46.830
What has...?

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:48.030
Mom!

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:50.470
What has my son done?

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:52.930
He ran off midway through his service.

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:54.690
It's a serious crime.

00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:57.010
Did you really?

00:07:58.510 --> 00:08:00.900
I heard you fell ill.

00:08:00.900 --> 00:08:03.040
So I wanted to get you this medicine.

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:07.770
Please have mercy!

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:09.360
I will take the punishment in his stead.

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:10.160
No!

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:12.080
Are you all right, Mom?

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:13.480
There, stand!

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:14.430
Mom!

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:19.460
Talga...

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:23.460
Mom!  Mom!

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:30.050
<i>Mom!</i>

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:37.520
Mom!  Mom!

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:40.730
Mom!

00:08:40.730 --> 00:08:42.580
Shut up!  Stay still!

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:46.380
Wait!

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:51.300
At least let him have a proper goodbye with his mother, please.

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:52.770
Out of the way, girl.

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:54.050
He's a criminal.

00:08:55.270 --> 00:08:56.510
Please!

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:00.350
You!

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:10.650
What do you think you're doing?

00:09:13.480 --> 00:09:15.280
Let them have their farewell.

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:17.150
What did you say?

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:24.310
Could you possibly be...?

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:41.640
Hey, let's go.

00:09:46.930 --> 00:09:48.390
Please get a hold of yourself.

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:50.480
Are you all right?

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:53.110
Let's take her back to her place to rest.

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:22.140
Will Yuan-san get better?

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:24.480
I gave her the medicine, but I can't really tell.

00:10:25.730 --> 00:10:28.300
We'll have to see how things go tonight.

00:11:06.130 --> 00:11:07.800
You're pretty good.

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:12.010
"My dear child, sleeping next to me."

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:14.190
"Have a sweet dream."

00:11:15.140 --> 00:11:15.970
Right?

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:17.970
Are those the lyrics to this song?

00:11:17.970 --> 00:11:20.230
What, you didn't know?

00:11:20.230 --> 00:11:23.080
No.  I heard it today for the first time.

00:11:23.470 --> 00:11:24.940
The first time?

00:11:24.940 --> 00:11:30.720
That's a song called "Bird of Dawn."  Somewhat like a lullaby.

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:34.130
He was playing it on his harp.

00:11:34.430 --> 00:11:36.170
That man who stopped the government official.

00:11:37.430 --> 00:11:41.160
That strong guy plays a harp, eh?

00:11:41.940 --> 00:11:44.420
He was quick like a Sezan.

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:45.780
"Sezan?"

00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:52.620
Yeah.  Sezans are royal guards who protect the Queen.

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:56.100
They go through rigorous training to become one.

00:11:56.100 --> 00:11:57.690
I never knew there were such people.

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:03.910
Yeah.  They live abiding to their strict code and sever their relationships with their family.

00:12:06.690 --> 00:12:08.160
Code...

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:14.860
<i>We can't live unless we abide by the code.</i>

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:47.680
<i>Mom!</i>

00:12:47.980 --> 00:12:48.940
<i>Talga...</i>

00:13:03.930 --> 00:13:04.620
<i>Mom?</i>

00:13:22.810 --> 00:13:25.780
We must not do anything to stand out.

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:27.150
Such as what you did this afternoon.

00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:29.300
My apologies.

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:35.120
If you're influenced by emotion, you can't be a Sezan who serves the Queen.

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:36.310
Yes.

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:38.310
A mission.

00:13:38.780 --> 00:13:42.360
Here's the portrait of the egg thief who was lurking around a Touda breeder village.

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:47.510
Capture him as soon as you find him and find out where he was planning to pawn them off.

00:13:47.770 --> 00:13:49.580
It doesn't matter what you have to do.

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:51.220
Affirmative.

00:14:07.620 --> 00:14:09.030
You've come to.

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:11.070
Looks like the medicine has taken effect.

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:14.480
We can take a breather now.

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:27.650
Jone-san...

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:28.830
What happened to Talga?

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:34.790
Those who run away from service are sent to the mines in the north.

00:14:37.010 --> 00:14:38.360
I see...

00:14:45.510 --> 00:14:47.130
That foolish child...

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:48.950
Doing such a thing for me...

00:14:54.670 --> 00:14:55.940
Mokku!
Ani!

00:14:55.940 --> 00:14:56.440
Mokku!

00:14:56.440 --> 00:14:58.610
I feel so bad for her!

00:15:02.050 --> 00:15:03.280
Ani!

00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:06.700
A-Ani...

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:11.800
Little girl!  Ani's been taken away!

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:21.240
You must be the egg thief.

00:15:21.240 --> 00:15:23.620
No, I haven't stolen one, yet.

00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:24.760
Who ordered you to?

00:15:24.760 --> 00:15:27.460
I'll talk.  I'll speak.  I'll spill it all.

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:30.060
S-Some guy came up to me in the village of Touri.

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:32.450
He said he'd give me a lot of money if I gave one to him.

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:33.830
His name was...

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:55.390
Who are you?

00:16:00.530 --> 00:16:03.220
Ani...  Where are you?

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:08.240
Wait!

00:16:20.530 --> 00:16:22.360
Could he be Ial the Speed Runner?

00:16:22.860 --> 00:16:25.280
It's true that he's unbelievably fast.

00:16:55.670 --> 00:16:57.700
Ani!  Are you all right?

00:16:59.470 --> 00:17:01.030
I'm sorry!  I'm sorry!

00:17:01.030 --> 00:17:03.970
I'll never do it again, so please don't kill me!

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:06.900
What?  The little girl?  Mokku?

00:17:07.160 --> 00:17:08.050
Where did he go?

00:17:08.050 --> 00:17:08.860
Who's "he?"

00:17:09.640 --> 00:17:10.550
It's him!

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:17.510
Mokku, what was it?

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:19.220
What was what?

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:20.250
Concerning Touri village!

00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:21.770
Sessami tofu!

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:23.730
Idiot... that's not it!

00:17:23.990 --> 00:17:27.590
The name of the guy who approached us about stealing the eggs.

00:17:27.590 --> 00:17:29.380
Ah, that man...

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:31.330
Ian...  Bakan...

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:32.260
Ahan?

00:17:32.260 --> 00:17:33.130
Uhun?

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:34.930
No, it wasn't any of those!

00:17:39.770 --> 00:17:40.910
Stop!

00:17:42.470 --> 00:17:43.420
Move.

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:45.300
No.

00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:07.210
<i>My dear child, sleeping next to me,</i>

00:18:07.210 --> 00:18:15.280
<i>have a sweet dream.</i>

00:18:16.260 --> 00:18:18.480
<i>On this beautiful night we sleep next to each other,</i>

00:18:18.480 --> 00:18:19.750
This song...
