00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:25.420
<i>On this beautiful night we sleep next to each other,</i>

00:18:25.420 --> 00:18:33.550
<i>and you can even hear the voices of the frogs.</i>

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:34.600
I like this song.

