00:19:53.730 --> 00:19:55.650
Take care of yourself now.

00:19:55.650 --> 00:19:57.740
Yes.  Thank you for all your care.

00:19:58.010 --> 00:20:00.450
Stay well, Yuan-san.

00:20:00.850 --> 00:20:03.680
Please wait for Talga-san to come back.

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:06.920
