Ial.

00:21:35.460 --> 00:21:36.960
It's a nice harp.

00:21:36.960 --> 00:21:37.800
Yes.

00:22:02.480 --> 00:22:08.070
The harp given by the man had the name "Ial" carved into it.

00:22:09.390 --> 00:22:14.710
Erin couldn't understand why he gave her the harp.

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:25.590
But the tune which he played, "Bird of Dawn," became something unforgettable for Erin.

00:24:01.910 --> 00:24:06.040
Hey, Mokku.  There's a secret in the back room of the house that the little girl lives in.

00:24:06.040 --> 00:24:08.210
I love sweet bee secrete!

00:24:08.210 --> 00:24:10.840
Not "secrete!"  Secret!

00:24:10.840 --> 00:24:14.850
And, well, it looks like the little girl enters the room.

00:24:14.850 --> 00:24:16.840
What happens to Erin-chan?

00:24:16.840 --> 00:24:19.170
That's what we're going to go find out now.  Let's go!

00:24:19.170 --> 00:24:21.690
